# Speech (Android)

Request DAT microphone permission only after a user action. Attach Speech after `DeviceSessionState.STARTED`, launch state/locale/error/transcription collectors before `speech.start()`, handle partial and final results, and cancel collectors before removal. Host `RECORD_AUDIO` is only for live-phone MockDevice recognition. Speech is experimental.
